@startuml Deployment
title Despliegue - Servidor Ubuntu 24.04 (Docker Compose)

node "Servidor Ubuntu 24.04" {
  node "Docker Engine" {

    node "Contenedor: web (nginx)" as WEB {
      component "Angular SPA (build estatico)" as ANGULAR
      component "Nginx reverse proxy" as NGINX
    }

    node "Contenedor: api (aspnet)" as API {
      component "ASP.NET Core Web API\n(.NET 8)" as APINET
    }

    node "Contenedor: sqlserver" as DB {
      database "SQL Server 2022 (Linux)" as SQLSERVER
    }

    node "Volumen: sqlserver-data" as VOL
  }
}

actor "Usuario (navegador)" as USER

USER --> NGINX : HTTPS 443
NGINX --> ANGULAR : sirve archivos estaticos
NGINX --> APINET : proxy_pass /api/ (HTTP 8080)
APINET --> SQLSERVER : EF Core / TDS (1433)
SQLSERVER --> VOL : persistencia de datos

note right of NGINX
  Termina TLS (Let's Encrypt / certbot)
  Redirige /api/* al contenedor api
  Redirige resto a archivos Angular
end note

note bottom of DB
  Imagen oficial mcr.microsoft.com/mssql/server:2022-latest
  Variables: SA_PASSWORD, ACCEPT_EULA
end note

@enduml
